    "raw_output": "pub fn token_bucket_trace(capacity: i32, initial: i32, refill: i32, costs: &[i32]) -> Option<Vec<i32>> {\n    if capacity < 0 || initial < 0 || refill < 0 {\n        return None;\n    }\n    if initial > capacity {\n        return None;\n    }\n\n    let mut tokens = initial;\n    let mut result = Vec::new();\n\n    for &cost in costs {\n        if cost < 0 {\n            return None;\n        }\n\n        if tokens < cost {\n            result.push(-(tokens + 1));\n            continue;\n        }\n\n        tokens = (tokens + refill).min(capacity);\n        result.push(tokens - cost);\n    }\n\n    Some(result)\n}<|im_end|>",
